        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>', 'Hello {{firstName}},

Your password was changed at {{timestamp}} from {{ipAddress}}.

Review security: {{securityUrl}}', '[\"firstName\", \"timestamp\", \"ipAddress\", \"securityUrl\"]', '1', '2026-10-31 12:40:14.414', '2026-10-31 12:40:14.414');
