        <div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 8px;\">
          &copy; 2026 Hambak Tech &amp; Services (BN 9284726) &bull; Lekki LCDA, Lagos State, Nigeria
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>', 'SECURITY ALERT

Hello {{firstName}},
Event: {{eventType}}
Time: {{timestamp}}
IP: {{ipAddress}}
Details: {{details}}

If not you, secure your account now: {{securityUrl}}', '[\"firstName\", \"eventType\", \"details\", \"timestamp\", \"ipAddress\", \"securityUrl\"]', '1', '2026-10-31 12:40:14.417', '2026-10-31 12:40:14.417');
